<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<org.eclipse.epf.uma:ContentDescription xmi:version="2.0" xmlns:xmi="http://www.omg.org/XMI" xmlns:org.eclipse.epf.uma="http://www.eclipse.org/epf/uma/1.0.6/uma.ecore" xmlns:epf="http://www.eclipse.org/epf" epf:version="1.5.1" xmi:id="-qooJByW0ICSkJp07cTiZVA" name="sobre_o_magic_pact,_fTLxUB_gEe6SILfbnF5lkQ" guid="-qooJByW0ICSkJp07cTiZVA" authors="Gabriel Bonfim Co-Authors: João G. A. Bradachi, Maria E. P. Braga, Ana F. Bonfim, Kelvin F. Veloso" changeDate="2024-09-04T17:36:06.114-0300" changeDescription="Criação da categoria" version="1.0">
  <mainDescription>&lt;p&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>Seguindo os princípios do manifesto&#xD;
    ágil,&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;strong>MAGIC-PACT&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>(&lt;em>Merging Agile Goals, Inspiring&#xD;
    Collaboration, Powerful Action &amp;amp; Creative Thinking&lt;/em>) é o processo de software que trabalha, de forma quase&#xD;
    mágica, com os recursos disponíveis do projeto integrador. Esse processo tem como objetivo unir os times de diferentes&#xD;
    matérias, promovendo e recompensando o trabalho em equipe e a proatividade.&lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/p>&#xD;
&lt;p&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>O contexto da criação do&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;strong>MAGIC-PACT&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>é o do&#xD;
    desenvolvimento de um software destinado ao ensino fundamental I, entre o 1º e 5º ano, seguindo o novo update da BNCC.&#xD;
    O ciclo de vida do processo, ilustrado abaixo, visa ser o mais enxuto possível e&amp;nbsp;sem complicações, mas focando na&#xD;
    qualidade da comunicação dos membros da equipe&lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/p>&#xD;
&lt;br&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot; />&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;br />&#xD;
&lt;p&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&#xD;
    &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;img style=&quot;HEIGHT: 647px; WIDTH: 1187px&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./resources/Projeto%20integrador.png&quot;&#xD;
    width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; />&#xD;
&lt;/p>&#xD;
&lt;br />&#xD;
&lt;p&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>O ciclo de vida do&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;strong>MAGIC-PACT&lt;/strong>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>pode ser dividido em&#xD;
    duas etapas principais, o Planejamento e a Integração.&lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/p>&#xD;
&lt;h5&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>Primeiro período - Planejamento:&lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/h5>&#xD;
&lt;p&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>Nessa etapa, que ocorre durante a disciplina de Engenharia de Software I, os alunos da disciplina&#xD;
    se&amp;nbsp;unem para levantar ideias para o projeto.&amp;nbsp;São recomendadas sessões&#xD;
    de&amp;nbsp;&lt;em>brainstorming&lt;/em>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>entre todos os integrantes. Após isso são&#xD;
    levantados&amp;nbsp;os&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;strong>Requisitos&lt;/strong>, que são refinados&#xD;
    na&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;strong>Análise&lt;/strong>&amp;nbsp;junto à produção do&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;em>diagrama de classes a&#xD;
    nível de&amp;nbsp;domínio&lt;/em>. Finalmente, na&amp;nbsp;fase de&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong>Design&lt;/strong>, os protótipos&amp;nbsp;e demais&#xD;
    diagramas são produzidos.&lt;br />&#xD;
    &lt;br />&#xD;
    &lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/p>&#xD;
&lt;h5&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>Segundo período - Integração:&lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/h5>&#xD;
&lt;p&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>Ao longo dessa etapa, que envolve a integração das disciplinas de Engenharia de Software II, Programação&#xD;
    Orientada a Objetos, Banco de Dados e Arquitetura de Software, ocorrem as iterações seguindo o modelo acima. Antes de,&#xD;
    de fato, se iniciarem as sprints de duas semanas de duração, a fase de preparação ocorre para que os alunos das&#xD;
    disciplinas de unam, se conheçam e se familiarizem uns com os outros e com as ferramentas e conceitos que serão&#xD;
    utilizados ao longo do período para o desenvolvimento do projeto.&lt;br />&#xD;
    &lt;br />&#xD;
    &lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/p>&#xD;
&lt;p&#xD;
style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 13px; FONT-FAMILY: arial, helvetica, sans-serif, kanji2; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial&quot;>&#xD;
    &lt;font size=&quot;2&quot;>As sprints se iniciam com a definição do&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;em>sprint backlog&lt;/em>, seguido&#xD;
    do&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;em>refinamento&lt;/em>. O refinamento em meio a sprint é um momento de melhoria da especificação dos&#xD;
    requisitos e um refinamento geral, visando facilitar o entendimento dos desenvolvedores e analistas menos experientes.&#xD;
    Então, o&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;em>desenvolvimento&lt;/em>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>se inicia e os alunos das disciplinas de POO e BD&#xD;
    recebem o que devem fazer e uma explicação por parte de seus respectivos&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;em>scrum masters&lt;/em>.&#xD;
    Quando as implementações são finalizadas, os analistas de qualidade fazem uma análise do código e dão início ao momento&#xD;
    de&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;em>testes&lt;/em>. Os testes avaliam o funcionamento do novo incremento e, quando tudo é corrigido,&#xD;
    esse incremento é aprovado. Gerando um resultado positivo ou negativo, a fase&#xD;
    de&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;em>feedback&lt;/em>&lt;span>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>é iniciada, onde os resultados da sprint são discutidos e as&#xD;
    métricas de sprint são geradas.&lt;/font>&#xD;
&lt;/p>&#xD;
&lt;br />&#xD;
&lt;br /></mainDescription>
</org.eclipse.epf.uma:ContentDescription>
